@@ -8893,3 +8893,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-10: FOURTH ARC-AGI-3 game first-solve via ACTIVE DYNAMICS EXPLORATION (the exp3993 pruner-rejected-unseen-dynamics fix; raises games-solved 3->4): exp3993's verifier-pruner rejected EVERY action because it pruned a dynamics model that was never induced (induced_mechanic=none). FIX THE ORDER: (1) a dedicated ACTIVE-EXPLORATION phase that probes the env with a budget of exploratory actions to OBSERVE transitions; (2) induce the mechanic + goal predicate from the OBSERVED transitions; (3) THEN apply the GAP-4 verifier as an action-pruner on the now-grounded model. Solve level-1 of the next-easiest NON-SPATIAL game (tn36-ef4dde99 / su15-1944f8ab / dc22 — picked empirically by smallest L0 baseline_actions + inducibility). A 4th distinct solved game raises generalization 3->4. Real-env-confirmed; AVOID vc33's PSPACE spatial trap. Report first_solve_at_action + actions_vs_baseline + exploration_actions_used. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: fourth_game_solved_su15-1944f8ab_at_action14; results/experiment_4004_fourth_game_explore_first.json
 - 2026-06-10: ArcMemo SOLVE-transfer v3 (self-learning MANDATE; extends the exp3994 2668->17 win to NEW content): exp3994 showed concept-memory-seeded solving cut actions 2668->17 on a held-out solved game. This tests whether the SAME concept memory makes the NEW content from this milestone cheaper: the higher level r11l reached in exp4003 (e.g. L4) OR the 4th game from exp4004 (or sc25 re-held-out if neither advanced). Two arms at equal perception: (A) cold-start (no memory), (B) concept-memory-seeded (retrieve+try the banked concepts: 'select-then-place' r11l, 'permute-set' lp85, 'pattern-match-then-navigate' sc25 + any new concept). Does retrieving banked concepts reduce ACTIONS/ATTEMPTS to solve genuinely NEW content vs cold-start? This is Tier-2 constraint memory (research-program.md) compounding across the milestone's own progress — the self-learning datum. POSITIVE CONTROL: the target must share structure with >=2 banked concepts (else transfer is impossible by construction; FALSE_NEGATIVE_RISK). (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: arcmemo_solve_transfer_v3_14to10_actions; results/experiment_4005_arcmemo_solve_transfer_v3.json
 - 2026-06-10: Hardware continuity (consolidated): SSH/USB-reachability + terminal-state check for each attached board — KV260 (ssh kria, xmutil listapps), GateMate (openFPGALoader -c dirtyJtag --detect), PolarFire (ssh polarfire). Record per-board reachability + the next concrete forward step; no bitstream redesign. Per north-star §3, KV260 is the sovereignty story to drive to terminal then freeze; GateMate/PolarFire are opportunistic. Per CLAUDE.md KV260 SSH-Not-SD-Card Discipline: NEVER use the host SD-card block device as a KV260 precondition (SSH-reachability is the ONLY valid KV260 precondition). Use DISTINCT wall-clock timers per board (the exp3866 TAUTOLOGY corrigendum). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: hardware_continuity_4006_kvreachable_overlay_absent_gmblocked_gatemate_unreachable_pfreachable_ssh_continuity_recorded; results/experiment_4006_hardware_continuity.json
+- 2026-06-10: Capstone .370 (UNGATED — the .365 op:exists + .366 no-artifact lessons): the milestone's headline question is IS THE GAP-4 VERIFIER NOW CONFIRMED, DECENTRALIZED, AND DEPLOYED (the thing .369 was prevented from answering by the poison-test cascade). Aggregate: CONFIRMED = the precision confirmation (exp3999 primary_gate_passed / agreement_is_selector_not_label) + de-selection coverage (exp3998 debiased_coverage_combined) + feedback-vs-redraw (exp4000 feedback_beats_redraw); DECENTRALIZED = the local-generator arm (exp4002 local_beats_vote + local_induction_demo_perfect_rate + the cost vs codex); DEPLOYED = the registration + bit-exact replay (exp4001 verifier_registered + arc2_reproduced_19of31 + arc1_reproduced_28of31). Plus ARC-AGI-3 ACCURACY (exp4003 new_levels_this_task + ACCURACY_total_levels_solved + exp4004 game_solved -> total_games_solved) and SELF-LEARNING (exp4005 solve_transfer_win). Record pretest_suite_green (exp3997) — did the poison-guard hold. Honest verdict on whether .370 CONFIRMED + DECENTRALIZED + DEPLOYED the verifier and advanced ARC accuracy. SKIP any flagged_adversarial artifact; cite upstream sha256. NO gated_on — aggregate whatever exists. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=success: capstone_v370_gap4_PHASE_RAN_UNCONFIRMED_DECENTRALIZED_DEPLOYED_local_not_beats_vote_games4_levels5_arcmemo_transfer_win_missing1_flagged_skipped0; results/experiment_4007_capstone_v370.json
